@host = http://localhost:5080

### First call is slow (miss), repeat it and it's instant (hit)
GET {{host}}/products/1

### Update evicts product:1, so the next GET reloads it
PUT {{host}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mechanical keyboard", "price": 89.99 }

### Cached per user: try X-User alice and bob
GET {{host}}/me/favourites
X-User: alice
